  "content": "<table style=\"width:97.8049%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding-left:5px;width:20.0999%\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fsodium\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kerudion/chunksfadein/main/readme-assets/req_sodium.png\" alt=\"需要 Sodium\" width=\"150\"> </a></td>\n<td style=\"padding-left:5px;width:20.0999%\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmodmenu\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kerudion/chunksfadein/main/readme-assets/works_modmenu.png\" alt=\"兼容 Mod Menu\" width=\"150\"> </a></td>\n<td style=\"padding-left:5px;width:20.0999%\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252firis\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kerudion/chunksfadein/main/readme-assets/works_iris.png\" alt=\"兼容 Iris 光影\" width=\"150\"> </a></td>\n<td style=\"width:19.6005%\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kerudion/chunksfadein/main/readme-assets/works_sinytra.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"150\"></td>\n<td style=\"padding-left:5px;width:20.0999%\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/optifabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kerudion/chunksfadein/main/readme-assets/crashes_opti.png\" alt=\"与 Optifabric 冲突\" width=\"150\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/fPbPhrQNSz\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1052166699924856852?style=for-the-badge&amp;color=informational&amp;logo=discord\" alt=\"Discord 服务器\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcrowdin.com%252fproject%252fchunks-fade-in\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/crowdin-协助翻译-blue?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=crowdin\" alt=\"Crowdin\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>模组描述</h2><p>此模组为区块加载添加了平滑的淡入和动态动画效果，类似于《我的世界》基岩版和<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/chunk-animator\" rel=\"nofollow\">ChunkAnimator</a>模组，同时还包含其他独特功能。它能与<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fsodium\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sodium</a>、（基本）兼容<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fdistanthorizons\" rel=\"nofollow\">Distant Horizons</a>以及（基本）兼容<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252firis\" rel=\"nofollow\">Iris</a>无缝协作。从此区块再也不会凭空突然出现在你眼前！</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h4>支持的 Minecraft 版本</h4><ul>\n<li>1.18.x</li>\n<li>1.19.x</li>\n<li>1.20.x</li>\n<li>1.21.x</li>\n</ul><h4>积极维护的版本（可能扩展）</h4><ul>\n<li>1.20.1 (长期支持版)</li>\n<li>1.21.1 (长期支持版)</li>\n<li>1.21.6-1.21.8</li>\n<li>1.21.9-1.21.10</li>\n<li>1.21.11</li>\n</ul><h4>支持的模组加载器</h4><ul>\n<li>Fabric/Quilt（全部）</li>\n<li>NeoForge（1.21+）</li>\n<li>Forge（1.20.1）</li>\n</ul><h4>依赖项（可能兼容其他版本）</h4><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fsodium\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sodium</a> 0.5.13 或 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fembeddium\" rel=\"nofollow\">Embeddium</a> 0.3.31 - 适用于 1.20.1</li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fsodium\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sodium</a> 0.6.13 或 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fembeddium\" rel=\"nofollow\">Embeddium</a> 1.0.15 - 适用于 1.21.1</li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fsodium\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sodium</a> 0.7.3 - 适用于 1.21.6-1.21.10</li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fsodium\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sodium</a> 0.8.2 - 适用于 1.21.11</li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><h3>功能特性</h3><h4>效果展示</h4><p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/8QDTzGK01ls\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><h4>支持 Mod Menu 的灵活配置！</h4><p><img src=\"https://github.com/kerudion/chunksfadein/raw/main/readme-assets/config.png?raw=true\" width=\"590\" height=\"533\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
